# The image is built from the wheel produced by the build-core job plus the
# lockfile that pins its dependencies, plus the default configuration.yaml
# baked into the image (committed here, not copied in at build time like
# pyproject.toml/uv.lock). Everything else stays out of the build context.
*
!dist/*.whl
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!configuration.yaml
